        },
        {
          "_type": "UMLNode",
          "_id": "QkfoPyArntf4SyPuYRm/",
          "_parent": {
            "$ref": "8OHEnfixaIe8TzSwOSx8"
          },
          "name": "hostPath /home/mstro/k3s-pod-data - mongodb, kafka, agent-home, agent-state, playwright-output, tailscale, usr-local",
          "visibility": "public"
        },
        {
          "_type": "UMLNote",
          "_id": "3eNh10+1IAkqO/R0Snap",
          "_parent": {
            "$ref": "8OHEnfixaIe8TzSwOSx8"
          },
          "text": "Reading guide\nOne k3s node runs ns campaign (finder, apply-worker, campaign-api,\nkafka-0, mongo-0, msrouter) and ns default (lubuntu-agent).\nImages are built on the host with docker and imported with\nk3s ctr images import; there is no registry.\nmsrouter is pinned to 0 replicas and finder runs with\nFINDER_SCORING_ENABLED=false while the pipeline is paused.\nfinder and apply-worker reach Chrome over CDP at the node IP\nport 30922 (NodePort 9222:30922).\nHost data lives under /home/mstro/k3s-pod-data, owned by mstro.\nThe laptop host sshd does not auto-start after a reboot."
        },
